content.text:
The root cause is the `recommendation` service: its only pod is crash-looping, so frontend's `/recommendations` requests fail with HTTP 500.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "recommendation",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT metric, attr_k8s_deployment_name AS dep, count(*) AS n, avg(value) AS v, min(value) AS mn, max(value) AS mx FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric = 'k8s.deployment.available' AND attr_k8s_deployment_name = 'recommendation' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "recommendation deployment has 0 available replicas for the whole abnormal window (normal was 1)."},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT 'abn' AS p, metric, attr_k8s_pod_name AS pod, count(*) AS n, avg(value) AS v FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'recommendation-%' AND metric IN ('k8s.container.restarts','k8s.container.ready') GROUP BY ALL UNION ALL SELECT 'norm', metric, attr_k8s_pod_name, count(*), avg(value) FROM normal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'recommendation-%' AND metric IN ('k8s.container.restarts','k8s.container.ready') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "recommendation pod restarts averaged about 4.7 and container readiness dropped to 0, versus 0 restarts and ready in normal."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name = 'recommendation' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Only one recommendation span appears in the abnormal window, against 882 in normal."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n, avg(duration)/1e6 AS avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name = 'frontend' AND span_name = 'recommendation.Recommendation/GetRecommendations' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Frontend's calls to recommendation return Error in about 0.02 ms, consistent with the connection being refused, not timing out."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "recommendation", "to": "frontend",
     "evidence": [
       {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_http_response_status_code AS code, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name = 'frontend' AND span_name = 'HTTP /recommendations' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Frontend's HTTP /recommendations server spans return 500 with Error status for 857 requests; none in normal."}
     ]}
  ]
}
```
